global decDate, klar

on exitFrame
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] setglobal 20 ............................ klar = 0
  [  3] pushint8 35 ............................. <35>
  [  6] pusharglist 1 ........................... <35>
  [  8] extcall 6 ............................... <sprite(35)>
  [ 10] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 11] setobjprop 7 ............................ sprite(35).visible = 0
  [ 13] pushint8 40 ............................. <40>
  [ 16] pusharglist 1 ........................... <40>
  [ 18] extcall 6 ............................... <sprite(40)>
  [ 20] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 21] setobjprop 7 ............................ sprite(40).visible = 0
  [ 23] pushint8 41 ............................. <41>
  [ 26] pusharglist 1 ........................... <41>
  [ 28] extcall 6 ............................... <sprite(41)>
  [ 30] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 31] setobjprop 7 ............................ sprite(41).visible = 0
